<div class="mandarin-hanzi">机场</div>
<div class="mandarin-pinyin">jīchǎng</div>

''Meaning:'' airport  
''Part of speech:'' noun

!! In context
机场离这里很远。 — Jīchǎng lí zhèlǐ hěn yuǎn. — The airport is far from here.

!! Usage note
去机场 (qù jīchǎng) means 'go to the airport'. Distinguish the facility 机场 from 飞机 (fēijī, 'airplane') and 坐飞机 (zuò fēijī, 'travel by plane').
